WEBVTT

00:07:28.152 --> 00:07:31.447
I seen his whole life change completely.

00:07:31.447 --> 00:07:33.824
Again he thought this is a sign

00:07:33.824 --> 00:07:36.911
that maybe God
doesn't want me to do drugs,

00:07:36.952 --> 00:07:39.163
drink alcohol or have sex.

00:07:39.205 --> 00:07:42.082
But no, that's not the case.

00:07:42.124 --> 00:07:43.375
Thank you.

00:07:44.460 --> 00:07:47.880
He was just simply learning discipline
without knowing.

00:07:48.881 --> 00:07:51.175
Alright. I have a confession to make.

00:07:52.259 --> 00:07:56.180
Because I don't want to make
this entire TED Talk about myself,

00:07:56.222 --> 00:07:58.224
I lied and said that this is a friend.

00:07:58.265 --> 00:07:59.808
(Laughter)

00:07:59.808 --> 00:08:01.101
It was actually me.